OL,3,GNEWSACoronation Street star returns to
OL,4,Acobbles after 11 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoronation Street star Ian
OL,7,FPuleston-Davies is returning to the
OL,8,Fsoap opera more than a decade after he
OL,9,Fleft.
OL,11,FThe 67-year-old will reprise his role
OL,12,Fas Owen Armstrong almost 11 years after
OL,13,Fthe character left Weatherfield,
OL,14,Ffollowing the collapse of his business
OL,15,Fand breakdown of his relationship with
OL,16,FAnna Windass.
OL,18,FThe no-nonsense builder's return will
OL,19,Fsee him move in with daughter Izzy and
OL,20,Fgrandson Jake, and making it clear he
OL,21,Fblames Anna Windass' son, Gary Windass,
OL,22,Ffor his family's misfortune.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
